# Environment.
#
# `.env` IS versioned here, deliberately. The Vite client resolves
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL / VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY at build time, so removing the
# file produced a deployed bundle that threw "Missing Supabase environment
# variable(s)" in the browser. The publishable (anon) key is public by design and
# is already shipped to every client.
#
# The guard that keeps this safe is `scripts/check-env.mjs`: the build fails if a
# service_role / sb_secret_ key ever appears in a tracked env file.
.env
!.env
!.env.example
.env.local
.env.*.local

